      "text": "Revenue grew at a 25.6% 3-year CAGR to ₹90,330 Cr TTM with PAT of ₹22,067 Cr and an 18% ROE.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "Quarterly momentum accelerated with revenue rising from ₹21,013 Cr in Dec 2025 to ₹24,546 Cr in Sep 2026 and PAT from ₹4,066 Cr to ₹6,367 Cr.",
      "source_ids": [
       "SCR"
      ]
     },
     {
      "text": "The company operates a diversified NBFC with a digital-first platform spanning consumer lending, home loans, loan against securities, deposits, insurance, and payments.",
